WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.074
Consonant digraphs such as sh, ch and ck form familiar sounds; sounds help decode

00:00:06.074 --> 00:00:06.493
words.

00:00:07.367 --> 00:00:10.567
Which word begins with the digraph sh? Answer: ship

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:17.020
Read and write five words containing sh, ch or ck; use two in sentences.

00:00:17.867 --> 00:00:21.920
Discuss why: The letters sh represent a single consonant sound.
